1
00:00:01,062 --> 00:00:03,609
As Uke comes to grab both shoulders from behind

2
00:00:03,610 --> 00:00:04,551
draw him to you

3
00:00:05,052 --> 00:00:07,177
as he comes round you for the second shoulder

4
00:00:07,578 --> 00:00:11,059
lead forward and drop your body weight down 
so Uke goes passed you, 

5
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:13,427
keeping control of that same arm

6
00:00:13,428 --> 00:00:15,635
extend forward deeply to his rear corner,

7
00:00:16,836 --> 00:00:17,793
as you cut down

8
00:00:17,794 --> 00:00:19,518
move forward with him controlling his arm,

9
00:00:19,519 --> 00:00:21,015
turning his body over,

10
00:00:21,016 --> 00:00:23,069
holding his arm close against your body

11
00:00:23,070 --> 00:00:25,894
with his shoulder in between your knees for the pin.

